The teaching script, player-aid layout/design, and build scripts created for
this kit (including but not limited to `teaching-script/`, `player-aid/source/build.py`,
`player-aid/source/extract_icons.py`, and the written wording of
`player-aid/captain-sonar-player-aid.pdf`) are © Seth Ladd and are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(CC BY-SA 4.0).

You are free to:
