  - Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose,
    even commercially

Under the following terms:
  - Attribution — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the
    license, and indicate if changes were made.
  - ShareAlike — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you
    must distribute your contributions under the same license as the
    original.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

2. Captain Sonar game content
------------------------------

Captain Sonar, its name, rules, and iconography are © 2022 Matagot. The
icons in `player-aid/source/icons/` are cropped directly from the official
rulebook and are reproduced here solely as an unofficial fan aid for
teaching the game. This game content is NOT covered by the CC BY-SA license
above, is not licensed by Matagot, and remains the property of its
respective owner. All rights to Captain Sonar are reserved by Matagot.

This kit is unofficial, non-commercial fan material and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Matagot.
